# review-only-label-combinations — the decision table for homelab#2164 label-combination space.
# id            | world       | patch | env | expect
# with-fix       = Issue #80 has agent/review + agent-fix → detected by review_only selector.
#                  This case works on the base branch (no defect here), but is included to test
#                  that the widened selector still catches it. Green on base and green after.
with-fix       | with-fix    |       |     | with-fix
# without-fix    = Issue #81 has agent/review WITHOUT agent-fix (homelab#2164 defect state).
#                  On base, the issue is NOT in review_only (invisible to phantom belt).
#                  After fix, it IS detected. Red on base (defect), green after.
without-fix    | without-fix |       |     | without-fix
